{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A facility run by a mysterious director conducting research into quantifying fear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The user will be a test subject there, undergoing terrifying experiences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It's a simple game in which the player must simply endure the terror of cockroaches without being scared.<br><br>Features<br>1.Single-player experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2.Explore the laboratory to locate the giant cockroach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3.Encounter cockroaches of various sizes throughout your journey. Endure the terror as they creep toward you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4.Complete the game by defeating the giant cockroach and escaping from the laboratory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">5.Gameplay duration: Approximately 15-30 minutes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3616840?t=1747869390","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3616840?t=1747869390","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616840/465118dd6e61c239c06ee9546bcb9e3d678e0ea6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747869390","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616840/465118dd6e61c239c06ee9546bcb9e3d678e0ea6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747869390","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"fear, insect"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A facility run by a mysterious director conducting research into quantifying fear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The user will be a test subject there, undergoing terrifying experiences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It's a simple game in which the player must simply endure the terror of cockroaches without being scared.<br><br>Features<br>1.Single-player experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2.Explore the laboratory to locate the giant cockroach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3.Encounter cockroaches of various sizes throughout your journey. Endure the terror as they creep toward you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4.Complete the game by defeating the giant cockroach and escaping from the laboratory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">5.Gameplay duration: Approximately 15-30 minutes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["\u682a\u5f0f\u4f1a\u793e\u30b0\u30c3\u30c9\u30d3\u30b8\u30e7\u30f3"],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616840/eaafccd06f8533a4ce3bac7e27388df55004c6f8/header.jpg?t=1747869390","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257142106,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257142106/movie480.mp4?t=1747869388","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257142106/movie_max.mp4?t=1747869388"},"name":"FEAR OF BUGS 2","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257142106/6ffdcd18ea15bdf599fafbc17e1bf05d5f6f9064/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1747869388","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257142106/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1747869388","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257142106/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1747869388"}}],"name":"FEAR OF BUGS 2","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i3-6100 / AMD